flowchart LR
    H[Assistant host<br/>Self-contained request] --> G[HTTP gateway<br/>Route and meter by MCP headers]
    G --> A[MCP worker A<br/>Validate metadata and access]
    G --> B[MCP worker B<br/>Validate metadata and access]
    A --> P[Report service<br/>Authorized jobs and results]
    B --> P
    P --> D[(Durable business state)]
    N[No protocol session owner<br/>Each worker has the same contracts] -.-> G
